;    1: TDecorate(count=138, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=1201, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=さ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=わ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=たもと, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おこ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1653, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1503, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\篠崎ハジメバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo Niimura-san</STYLE>, I am glad to see you in good health."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shinozaki-san<STYLE ID="2"> said that before anything else.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, thanks to you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">As I saw that face and heard that voice, my </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="さ">rusty</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> memories came back to life.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Yes. I cannot simply grow old and die like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There is still something I must do.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">To find out what Droga truly is, and to bring true peace to this settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The peace this settlement has now is a makeshift peace, painted over by Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Surely </STYLE>Shinozaki-san<STYLE ID="2"> has brought the answer with him.</STYLE><PG>
"I am deeply sorry for the delay. 
{PAUSE ""}
Our research on the drug in question is complete."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">With that, Shinozaki-san set down a thick sheaf of papers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"And... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">what did you find?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"To be frank... 
{PAUSE ""}
we have reached the conclusion that the drug is not something human beings should lay hands on."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I see..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Shinozaki-san's<STYLE ID="2"> account―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The spores contained in Droga, the horror of the Verde mummy, an evil being called the Goddess.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There lay the answer to 'a drug of cause and effect,' which I had pondered since I was young.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\篠崎ハジメバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"And also... 
{PAUSE ""}
This is very difficult for me to say, but I told you one lie."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Shinozaki-san<STYLE ID="1">, do you mean that you are not from the government?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You were aware of it...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I had no proof of it, though. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But now, government or not, I am very grateful that you have come like this to tell me."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE>Shinozaki-san<STYLE ID="2"> offered his </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="わ">apologies</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> once more and left the settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Looking through the report, I found that along with the research results, it set out their purpose.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">They were the descendants and comrades of the people who long ago </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="たもと">parted ways</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> with the Arata settlement, and it seemed they were now a sect called the Holy Cerejeira Church.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The sect revered Droga as a sacred treasure.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">At some point, the leader of the sect began to have doubts about how Droga worked.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was exactly what the previous Grand Witch had been thinking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">To unravel it, they had needed Droga's raw material, which is to say, the cherry trees here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Among the sect's believers were people connected to the government, so they had also been able to secure a certain budget.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But now that the true nature of Droga was known, the sect was falling apart.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I cannot die yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, I am not even permitted to step down from the role of Grand Witch.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I have a duty.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A duty to convey the horror of Droga to everyone.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ban Droga!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What do you mean by this, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Droga is essential to our way of life!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Why such a thing...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No sooner had I gathered everyone at the meeting hall and issued a ban on Droga than this happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I had known it would come to this.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">In the past, bans on Droga had been issued in the settlement several times.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But as time passed, the horror of Droga faded, and people would lay hands on this devil's drug again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That history had kept repeating itself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That, too, must end here.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I deliberately did not tell everyone the reason for the ban.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even if I banned it the same way as before, history would only repeat itself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That was why I would rid this settlement of Droga by a different method.</STYLE><PG>
Shinozaki-san<STYLE ID="2">, I had also thought, might be asked to dispose of the cherry tree at the Niimura main house as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But the Shigatsu Youka is a fungus, a relative of the strongly parasitic honey fungus.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Removing the fruiting bodies above ground is merely a drop in the bucket.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I shut myself up in the storehouse and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="おこ">composed</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> a new book to add to the storehouse's books.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">First, I would change the way the settlement conducted its memorial services.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The falsificaso that appears as a by-product when Droga is refined would be treated as a tool of the rites.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Falsificaso works as a wonder drug for those infected with Droga.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">By making it one of the rite tools in this way, falsificaso will go on being made for all time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Of course, this carries the danger that Droga will be refined as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But in any case, everyone knows how to make Droga, and it is written in the storehouse's books too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There is little point in banning the refining of Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then one need only make the wonder drug at the same time.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------